  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BSF-Human Rights, Democracy, Good Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the mass student uprising in July-August 2024 and the subsequent swearing in of an Interim Government, the political scenario of the country has changed significantly and Bangladesh has now entered a period of transition. In this context, Denmark has expressed to the Interim Government that the objectives of the BDP would be best achieved if supplemented by an additional objective in support of its reform agenda within Human Rights, Democracy and Good Governance, and received support and appreciation thereof. To this end, Denmark has decided to contribute an additional DKK 35 million to the BDP, for interventions in Human Rights, Democracy and Good Governance.</narrative>
  </description>
